"Compatibility score and the cross-aspects behind it for two birth charts, "
"rendered into the page by api.astroway.info. No key needed."
msgstr ""
"Оценка совместимости и лежащие в ее основе взаимосвязи для двух натальных "
"карт, отображенные на странице с помощью api.astroway.info. Легенда не "
"требуется."

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Tarot Spread of the Day (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Расклад таро дня (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "spread"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "celtic cross"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Three cards or the Celtic Cross, drawn once a day for this site, each card "
"read in its position. A visitor can draw again."
msgstr ""
"Три карты или Кельтский крест, выпадающие раз в день для этого сайта; каждая"
" карта прочитана в своей позиции. Посетитель может разложить ещё раз."

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Moon Transit Timeline (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Временная линия транзитов Луны (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "transit"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "week"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The next seven days of Moon ingresses, served by api.astroway.info as a "
"responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"Расписание вхождения Луны на ближайшие семь дней, предоставляемое сайтом "
"api.astroway.info в виде адаптивного iframe."

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Transit Sky (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Натальная карта (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "sky"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Snapshot of the transiting planets' signs and degrees for a date, served by "
"api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"Колесо натальной карты, обслуживаемое api.astroway.info в виде адаптивного "
"iframe."

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Horoscope for the Week (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Гороскоп на неделю (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "weekly"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Horoscope for the current week, anchored to Monday, rendered into the page "
"as text."
msgstr ""
"Гороскоп на текущую неделю, начиная с понедельника, отображенный на странице"
" в виде текста."

#: blocks/yearly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Horoscope for the Year (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Гороскоп на год (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/yearly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "yearly"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/yearly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "The year ahead for one zodiac sign."
msgstr "Год вперед для одного знака зодиака."

#: blocks/zodiac-compatibility/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Zodiac Compatibility (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Совместимость знаков зодиака (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/zodiac-compatibility/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "How two zodiac signs read together."
msgstr "Как два знака зодиака читаются вместе."

